server/sv_playstats.qc
// Patch 777: paint and saves between players; after sv_saveloc.qc (SV_SaveLocCreateAt, the
// rows), before sv_player.qc and sv_main.qc, which call it.
server/sv_share.qc
// Patch 811: lobby saves and the install's; after sv_share.qc (SH_MC_ONE), before sv_player.qc.
server/sv_savesync.qc
// Patch 915: timer identity/archive helpers and SH_MC_ONE precede private retrieval.
server/sv_archive.qc
// Shared transport policy precedes the player's included TAS sharing module.
